<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom says bought off-market at NZ$6.82.</title>
<headline>Telecom says bought off-market at NZ$6.82.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Monday it had bought back 102,390 shares off market on Friday at NZ$6.82 each, as part of its share buyback programme.</p>
<p>Telecom is buying both on and off market at present, and is likely to continue until it gives notice that this phase of the programme is completed.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
